# Smoke test: Level Builder phase 5 tile-edit flow
# Enter Development mode, switch to Select Tile Mode, exercise tile actions, then return to play.
wait startup
wait 250

press ENTER
wait 150

press E
wait 180

press C
wait 120

press D
wait 120
press X
wait 120
press Z
wait 120
press V
wait 120
press A
wait 120
press W
wait 120
press V
wait 120

press A
wait 120

press Q
wait 120

press ENTER
wait 150

keydown D
wait 1100
press SPACE
wait 900
keyup D
wait 250

press R
wait 250

exit